WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.626
Take South Africa.

2
00:00:01.626 --> 00:00:03.895
There is no separate crypto tax:

3
00:00:03.895 --> 00:00:09.638
profit is taxed as income or as a capital gain, and that is decided by the facts.

4
00:00:09.638 --> 00:00:12.474
Swapping one coin for another is barter.

5
00:00:12.474 --> 00:00:15.807
Since 2022 intermediaries need an FSCA licence,

6
00:00:15.807 --> 00:00:18.501
and CARF has applied since March 2026:

7
00:00:18.501 --> 00:00:22.046
SARS will match exchange data against your return.
